WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.317 --> 00:00:15.918
princess jumped into the lake.

2
00:00:20.360 --> 00:00:24.341
Underwater, she grabbed the prince's shoulders and tugged.

3
00:00:24.581 --> 00:00:25.862
But she couldn't move him.

4
00:00:28.003 --> 00:00:30.304
She came up for air and almost screamed.

5
00:00:31.748 --> 00:00:33.929
The water was up to the prince's eyes!

6
00:00:36.191 --> 00:00:37.491
Ellen tilted his head back.

7
00:00:38.292 --> 00:00:40.613
His nose and mouth were above the surface now.

8
00:00:40.633 --> 00:00:44.816
"But he's not breathing!"

9
00:00:45.256 --> 00:00:46.276
she thought in a panic.

10
00:00:46.296 --> 00:00:48.057
"What should I do?"

11
00:00:50.199 --> 00:00:54.321
Suddenly love—and water—brought back all her strength.

12
00:00:55.662 --> 00:00:59.124
She dived in again and pulled with her whole might.

13
00:01:00.396 --> 00:01:02.398
Finally, an arm came out of the hole.

14
00:01:04.400 --> 00:01:06.402
The rest of his body quickly followed.

15
00:01:07.963 --> 00:01:11.346
Reader, no one knows how the princess got him into the boat.

16
00:01:12.707 --> 00:01:14.369
But somehow she did this.

17
00:01:14.969 --> 00:01:18.192
Then she rowed the boat to shore as fast as she could.

18
00:01:22.316 --> 00:01:26.740
Using all her strength again, she pulled the prince onto land.

19
00:01:28.588 --> 00:01:31.089
His cheeks were pale, and his eyes were closed.

20
00:01:31.109 --> 00:01:35.830
"I'm too late," she thought.

21
00:01:35.850 --> 00:01:37.711
"He's dead!"

22
00:01:38.911 --> 00:01:40.491
Ellen's chest felt tight.

23
00:01:41.452 --> 00:01:47.193
She let out a strange sound, and her eyes filled with tears!

24
00:01:50.914 --> 00:01:55.135
As she cried for the first time ever, raindrops began to fall.

25
00:01:55.675 --> 00:01:57.416
And it wasn't an ordinary rain.

26
00:01:57.884 --> 00:02:01.688
It was the colors of rubies, sapphires, and emeralds.

27
00:02:02.728 --> 00:02:03.990
The rain grew stronger.

28
00:02:05.651 --> 00:02:09.014
Soon water flowed down mountains like liquid gold.

29
00:02:09.915 --> 00:02:12.097
Brooks and rivers streamed again.

30
00:02:13.438 --> 00:02:16.220
Babies' eyes filled with tiny tears.

31
00:02:17.501 --> 00:02:19.723
The water in the lake rose higher and higher.

32
00:02:22.466 --> 00:02:24.928
So did the water in Agnes' cellars.

33
00:02:29.280 --> 00:02:32.983
Crash! A powerful river suddenly burst through the cellars' doors and passages.

34
00:02:33.003 --> 00:02:36.507
"Oh no!"

35
00:02:37.147 --> 00:02:38.969
Agnes screamed.

36
00:02:39.810 --> 00:02:43.573
The churning flood water swept her away.

37
00:02:46.476 --> 00:02:48.317
The princess continued to cry.

38
00:02:51.120 --> 00:02:55.143
She cried so hard, she didn't see the prince open his eyes.

39
00:02:58.804 --> 00:02:59.925
"Are you crying for me?"

40
00:03:00.425 --> 00:03:00.965
he asked.

41
00:03:07.490 --> 00:03:12.633
alive!" The princess leaped up, forgetting to grab rocks.

42
00:03:14.615 --> 00:03:18.517
But she didn't float away.

43
00:03:19.478 --> 00:03:22.560
Instead she tumbled back down onto the ground!

44
00:03:22.580 --> 00:03:24.862
"You fell!"

45
00:03:25.222 --> 00:03:26.583
The prince was amazed.

46
00:03:26.603 --> 00:03:42.689
"That means You have Everyone in the kingdom rejoiced.

47
00:03:48.951 --> 00:03:51.772
Soon afterward Ellen and the prince got married.

48
00:03:56.748 --> 00:03:59.776
They had many children, who all had gravity.

49
00:04:00.939 --> 00:04:05.571
Together they laughed and cried, and lived happily ever after.
